{%- comment -%}
  Include from the theme's product-card snippet (commonly snippets/card-product.liquid
  or snippets/product-card.liquid depending on the theme) in place of the normal
  Add to Cart / Quick Add control, when the card's product is an affiliate product.

  The card's image and title should keep linking to the FCP product page
  (product.url) — do NOT point card links directly at the Mavely link. Only this
  bottom action control changes.

  Usage:
    {% assign is_affiliate = card_product.metafields.custom.affiliate_product.value %}
    {% if is_affiliate %}
      {% render 'affiliate-product-card-overrides', product: card_product %}
    {% else %}
      ... existing quick-add / add-to-cart control ...
    {% endif %}
{%- endcomment -%}

<a
  href="{{ product.url }}"
  class="button button--secondary affiliate-card-button"
>
  {{ product.metafields.custom.external_button_label.value | default: 'View Product' }}
</a>
